      "writtenOn": "2017-09-05T04:38:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If stop() is called while we\u0027re in STARTING it doesn\u0027t look like we unregister the observer because we never enter IDLE state. If so, perhaps do:\n\n    if (isStarting()) {\n        enterStoppingState();\n        enterIdleState();\n    } else {\n        // When clatd stops and its interface is deleted, interfaceRemoved() will notify\n        // ConnectivityService and call enterIdleState().\n        enterStoppingState();\n    }\n\nOr, alternatively, in enterStoppingState, do:\n\n        if (!isRunning()) {\n            // When clatd stops and its interface is deleted, interfaceRemoved() will notify\n            // ConnectivityService and call enterIdleState().            enterIdleState();\n        }",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 219,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 221,
        "endChar": 57
      },
      "revId": "63e284772f9153338006b1cb7d0def1b8e77ac51",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
